---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 所有標籤
description: 依標籤瀏覽這個部落格的文章。
permalink: /tags/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<h1>所有標籤</h1>

{% if collections.publicTags.length %}
  <ul class="tag-list">
    {%- for tag in collections.publicTags %}
      <li>
        <a href="{{ ('/tags/' + tag.slug + '/') | url }}">
          {{ tag.name }} <span class="tag-count">({{ tag.posts.length }})</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
{% else %}
  <div class="empty-state">
    <p>還沒有任何標籤。</p>
    <p>為文章加上標籤後，就能從這裡分類瀏覽。</p>
  </div>
{% endif %}
